WEBVTT

00:00:04.676 --> 00:00:11.416
MARMALADE BOY

00:00:11.416 --> 00:00:14.786
But it's still on my mind

00:00:14.786 --> 00:00:16.754
This morning,
more so than before...

00:00:18.056 --> 00:00:21.389
A dream was interrupted

00:00:21.527 --> 00:00:24.758
I want to know how it ends for...
him and me

00:00:31.203 --> 00:00:36.436
Ah, God, please stop time

00:00:36.942 --> 00:00:40.036
Can't ﬁnd my books...
school uniform...

00:00:40.178 --> 00:00:43.011
My hair won't dry yet

00:00:44.349 --> 00:00:49.810
Ah, help me... my ribbon
doesn't seem to go on right

00:00:50.455 --> 00:00:56.587
All because I dreamt of him

00:00:57.529 --> 00:01:01.295
When I bit into my
half—burnt piece of toast...

00:01:04.036 --> 00:01:08.837
All of a sudden
my heart started pounding

00:01:10.676 --> 00:01:15.545
Sweet and bitter marmalade

00:01:15.681 --> 00:01:18.149
That's why it's on my mind

00:01:18.684 --> 00:01:20.709
Why am I feeling this way?

00:01:22.187 --> 00:01:23.950
Alll want is

00:01:25.457 --> 00:01:28.949
to see his smile

00:02:45.404 --> 00:02:53.334
LOST LOVE —
"I LOVE YOU"

00:11:53.985 --> 00:11:56.613
MARMALADE BOY

00:12:02.760 --> 00:12:05.388
MARMALADE BOY

00:22:11.368 --> 00:22:12.357
MARMALADE BOY

00:22:35.292 --> 00:22:38.227
BREAKUP PREMONITION —
"THE HALLOWEEN CONSPIRACY."

00:22:49.273 --> 00:22:57.738
Mai ochiru kareha no naka ni

00:22:57.882 --> 00:23:05.220
Kimi no sugata ga mieru made

00:23:05.356 --> 00:23:13.229
Same kaketa coffee cup

00:23:13.898 --> 00:23:21.828
Boku wa ryoute de atatameteru

00:23:21.972 --> 00:23:25.066
I'm waiting for you, girl

00:23:25.209 --> 00:23:30.772
Umarete kara zutto
kono hi 0

00:23:30.915 --> 00:23:37.684
Matte ita kiga suru yo

00:23:37.888 --> 00:23:40.755
Just waiting for your love

00:23:40.891 --> 00:23:46.796
Jidai ni furi tsumoru
kimi e no

00:23:46.931 --> 00:23:54.201
Omoi ni umoretakute
